Version 3.0, PL6, Mac OS.

In the past, when eating too much, I've always been asked if I want to
continue.  Not this game.  I finally had a good character, all ready
to enter the maze levels, when I decided to go up a few levels and
womp on a few dragons I had left behind.  Killed a grey dragon,
nothing else was nearby, and I hadn't eaten in quite a while, so I
decided to eat it right there rather than tinning it.

You're having a tough time getting it all down -more-
You choke on your food -more-
You die...

Shouldn't I have been asked to continue?  If this isn't a bug, it
should be.

